# A4: OWL punning, properties with no domain or no range, and a class expression.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/zoo#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

ex:Bird a owl:Class .
ex:Species a owl:Class .
ex:Eagle a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Bird .
ex:Eagle a ex:Species .
ex:Hawk a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Bird .
ex:Raptor a owl:Class ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( ex:Eagle ex:Hawk ) ] .
ex:eats a owl:ObjectProperty .
ex:wingspan a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Bird .
ex:ringed a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:boolean .
